# Build MUSICED — A Global Social Network for Music Discovery and Reviews

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, SaaS architect, product designer and technical lead.

I want you to build a production-quality music discovery and social networking platform called **MUSICED**.

MUSICED is inspired by the social experience of Letterboxd, the music catalog and rating depth of Rate Your Music, and the music discovery culture of Album of the Year.

However, do NOT simply clone these platforms. Create a distinctive product identity, user experience and visual language.

The goal is to create a global community where people can discover music, rate albums, write reviews, maintain listening diaries, create collections, follow other listeners and explore music through community activity.

This is a serious SaaS startup project, not a basic portfolio application.

