## E. Rating system

Implement a 0.5–5 star rating system with half-star increments.

Requirements:
- One current rating per user per album.
- Users can edit their rating.
- Users can remove their rating.
- Display community average rating.
- Display rating distribution.
- Display total number of ratings.

Make the rating interaction intuitive and visually polished.

Calculate aggregate ratings using database queries or maintained aggregate statistics. Do not trust client-submitted aggregate values.

